1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,523
Five terms to use.

2
00:00:01,523 --> 00:00:06,223
It is a one act play: one room, one continuous afternoon.

3
00:00:06,223 --> 00:00:09,453
A duologue: only two speaking parts.

4
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:12,591
Its stage directions carry tone and gesture.

5
00:00:12,591 --> 00:00:14,062
It ends with a twist.

6
00:00:14,062 --> 00:00:19,166
And it contains a play within a play: the actress's own performance.

